#: ../../../developer/general/gsod.rst:5 b3c6b733834642e6b575d6962d8fab6c
msgid ""
"Google Season of Docs was a programme run by Google from 2019-2024, to "
"improve documentation for open-source software projects. Qubes OS took part "
"in GSoD, and our projects were completed within the times allotted. You can "
"read about our past projects below."
msgstr ""

